        "Reference arrows, Home/End and Space-plus-arrows are not this pin’s complete keyboard contract: installed largeStep uses Page keys and Shift-plus-arrows. Test those actual controls, track press, native range input and an exact-entry alternative. Keep focus, endpoint identity, disabled guards and immediate effects coherent."
